hadiths[13]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1310","Habib bin Abi Sabit rehmatullahi alaih se riwayat hai ke wo ye pasand karte the ke jab koi shakhs guftagu kare to kisi ek shakhs ke chehre ka qasd na kare balke khitab ko aam rakhe."
"1311","Ibn Abi Huzail rehmatullahi alaih se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood raziyallahu anhu apne ek sathi ke hamrah ek shakhs ki ayadat ke liye gaye phir jab dono ghar mein dakhil hue to ghar wale idhar udhar dekhne lage to Hazrat Abdullah raziyallahu anhu ne un se farmaya Allah ki qasam agar tum dono ki aankhen phod di jatin to ye tum dono ke liye behtar hota."
"1312","Nafi rehmatullahi alaih se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha Iraq walon mein se kuch log Hazrat Ibn Umar raziyallahu anhuma ke pas aaye pas unhon ne un ki ek kaniz ki gardan mein sone ka haar dekha phir un mein se kuch ek dusre ki taraf dekhne lage to Hazrat Ibn Umar raziyallahu anhuma ne farmaya beshak tumhari aankhen shar ko dekhne mein tez hain."
"1313","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya fuzul kalam mein koi bhalai nahin."
"1314","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya meri ummat ke badtareen aur zaleeltareen log kasrat se kalam karne wale guftagu mein tafaihuq karne wale apne munhon ko matak matak kar bolne wale hain aur meri ummat ke behtareen log akhlaq mein sab se achhe hain."
"1315","Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya logon mein se badtareen do chehron wala hai jo in ke pas ek chehre ke sath aata hai aur un ke pas dusre chehre ke sath."
"1316","Hazrat Ammar bin Yasir raziyallahu anhuma ne farmaya main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna jo shakhs duniya mein do chehron wala hoga qiyamat ke din us ke liye aag ki do zabaanen hongi phir ek bhari jism wala shakhs guzra to unhon ne farmaya ye unhi mein se hai."
"1317","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Malik ne mujh se bayan kiya Ibn Shihab se Saeed bin Musayyab se Abu Huraira se ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya pahalwan kushti larne wala nahin hai pahalwan to wo hai jo gusse ke waqt apne nafs ko qaboo mein rakhe."
"1318","Ahmad bin Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Abu Shihab Abd Rabbihi ne hum se bayan kiya Yunus se Hasan se Ibn Umar se unhon ne kaha Allah ke nazdeek ajr mein us ghunt se barh kar koi ghunt nahin jo gusse ka ghunt koi banda Allah ki raza ke liye zabt kare."
"1319","Ali bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Abu Usama ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha main ne Aamash ko kehte hue suna unhon ne kaha Adi bin Sabit ne hum se bayan kiya Sulaiman bin Surad se unhon ne kaha Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke samne do shakhs ek dusre ko bura bhala kehne lage pas un mein se ek gussa karne laga aur us ka chehra surkh hone laga pas Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us ki taraf dekha to farmaya beshak main ek kalima janta hun agar wo ye kahe to ye kaifiyat us se jati rahe Auzu billahi minash shaitanir rajim phir ek shakhs us shakhs ki taraf khara hua to kaha kya tum jante ho unhon ne kya farmaya unhon ne kaha kaho Auzu billahi minash shaitanir rajim to us shakhs ne kaha kya tum mujhe majnun samajhte ho."
"1319b","Abdullah bin Usman ne qirat karke hum se bayan kiya Abu Hamza se Aamash se Ibn Sabit se Sulaiman bin Surad se unhon ne kaha main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sath baitha tha aur do shakhs ek dusre ko bura bhala keh rahe the pas un mein se ek ka chehra surkh ho gaya aur us ki gardan ki ragen phool gayin to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya beshak main ek kalima janta hun agar wo ye kahe to jo kaifiyat wo pata hai us se jati rahe pas unhon ne us se kaha beshak Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya Allah se shaitan mardud se panah mang to us ne kaha kya mujhe koi junun hai."
"1320","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Abdul Wahid bin Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Lais ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Taus ne mujh se bayan kiya Ibn Abbas se unhon ne kaha Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya sikhao aur aasani karo sikhao aur aasani karo teen martaba aur jab tum gussa ho to khamosh ho jao do martaba."
"1321","Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Marwan bin Muawiya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ubaid al-Kindi ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Hazrat Ali ko Ibn al-Kawwa se kehte hue suna: kya tum jante ho ke awwal ne kya kaha: apne mehboob se aitedal se mohabbat karo, ho sakta hai ke woh kisi din tumhara dushman ban jaye, aur apne dushman se aitedal se bugz rakho, ho sakta hai ke woh kisi din tumhara mehboob ban jaye."
